<title>USA: US Diagnostic buys add $1 mln to pretax net.</title>
<headline>US Diagnostic buys add $1 mln to pretax net.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Diagnostic Inc said on Wednesday that it has bought 100 percent of two companies and that the acquisitions will add $1 million to its pre-tax income an an annualized basis.</p>
<p>The companies purchased were Medical Marketing Development Inc, a radiology and physician practice management company, and MRI of Monmouth P.C., an outpatient radiology facility in Tinton Falls, N.J.</p>
</text>
